{"detail":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"ko\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Security-Policy\" content=\"default-src 'none'; script-src 'none'; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; font-src 'self'; img-src https://daesan.ai https://*.daesan.ai https://cafe24img.com https://*.cafe24img.com https://www.kccworld.co.kr/assets/images/ho/bm/img_hb_mark.jpg; connect-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'\"><meta name=\"referrer\" content=\"no-referrer\"><style>@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:400;src:url(fonts/400) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:500;src:url(fonts/500) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:600;src:url(fonts/600) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:700;src:url(fonts/700) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:800;src:url(fonts/800) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}html,body{margin:0;padding:0}body{display:flow-root;font:12px/1.5 Pretendard,sans-serif;color:#353535}p,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6,ul,ol,li,dl,dt,dd,figure{margin:0;padding:0}table{width:100%;border:0;border-spacing:0;border-collapse:collapse}img{border:0;vertical-align:top;max-width:100%}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}#cafe24-detail{max-width:790px;margin:auto}@media(min-width:701px){#cafe24-detail h3.ds-block-title{font-size:12px;margin:0 0 20px}}@media(max-width:700px){body{font-size:13px;line-height:1.2;color:#1b1b1b}td,th{line-height:18px}#cafe24-detail{width:95.25%}}</style><style>\r\n\t.product-basic {\r\n\t\tmax-width: 1000px; margin: 40px auto; font-family: 'Apple SD Gothic Neo', 'Noto Sans KR', Arial, sans-serif; color: #333;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.product-basic h2 {\r\n\t\tfont-size: 34px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 6px;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.product-basic .en-title {\r\n\t\tfont-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; color: #555; margin: 0 0 20px;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.product-basic hr {\r\n\t\tborder: 0; border-top: 1px solid #999; margin: 20px 0 30px;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.spec-simple h3 {\r\n\t\tfont-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 18px;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.spec-row {\r\n\t\tdisplay: flex; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 12px;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.spec-row .label {\r\n\t\twidth: 120px; font-weight: 600;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.spec-row .value {\r\n\t\tcolor: #555;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t@media (max-width:768px) {\r\n\t\t.product-basic h2 {\r\n\t\t\tfont-size: 26px;\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t\t.product-basic .en-title {\r\n\t\t\tfont-size: 18px;\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t\t.spec-row {\r\n\t\t\tflex-direction: column;\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t\t.spec-row .label {\r\n\t\t\twidth: 100%; margin-bottom: 4px;\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t}\r\n\r\n\n\r\n\t.feature-sec {\r\n\t\tmax-width: 1000px; margin: 40px auto; font-family: 'Apple SD Gothic Neo', 'Noto Sans KR', Arial, sans-serif; color: #333;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.feature-title {\r\n\t\tfont-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 18px;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.feature-item {\r\n\t\tmargin-bottom: 26px;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.feature-item h4 {\r\n\t\tfont-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.feature-item p {\r\n\t\tfont-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: #555; margin: 0;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t@media (max-width:768px) {\r\n\t\t.feature-sec {\r\n\t\t\tpadding: 0 14px;\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t\t.feature-item h4 {\r\n\t\t\tfont-size: 20px;\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t}\r\n\r\n</style></head><body><div id=\"cafe24-detail\">\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"product-basic\">\r\n\r\n<h2>석고본드</h2>\r\n<div class=\"en-title\">Gypsum Bond</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<div class=\"spec-simple\">\r\n\r\n<h3>상품 사양</h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"spec-row\">\r\n<div class=\"label\">제조</div>\r\n<div class=\"value\">KCC,벽산(대한민국)</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"spec-row\">\r\n<div class=\"label\">단위</div>\r\n<div class=\"value\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85);font-family: &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;display: inline !important;float: none\">25Kg/포</span>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"spec-row\">\r\n<div class=\"label\">사용량</div>\r\n<div class=\"value\">2.5 Kg/㎡ (18mm 마감두께로 접착시)</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"feature-sec\">\r\n\r\n<div class=\"feature-item\">\r\n\r\n<h4>석고본드</h4>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n석고보드를 콘크리트 벽이나 콘크리트 블럭, 시멘트 벽돌, 조적벽 등에 부착할 때 사용되는 분말형 접착제로서 물에 반죽하여 사용됩니다.\r\n</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"feature-item\">\r\n\r\n<h4>적용 부위</h4>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n콘크리트 벽 또는 조적벽, ALC, 벽체 등에 석고본드를 이용하여 석고보드를 직접 고정하는 방법으로 평활한 벽면 및 다양한 마감처리를 할 수 있고, 시공성이 우수하여 기존의 시멘트 몰탈마감을 대체하는 공법입니다.\r\n</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"feature-item\">\r\n\r\n<h4>규격</h4>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n포장단위 : 25 Kg / Bag 사용량 : 2.5 Kg / ㎡ (18mm 마감두께로 접착 시)\r\n</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"feature-item\">\r\n\r\n<h4>HB마크란?</h4>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n국내·외에서 생산되는 건축자재에 대한 유기화합물(HCHO, TVOC) 방출 강도를 공인 시험기관에서 엄격하고 철저한 품질인증시험을 통해 평가하여, 그 결과에 따라 친환경인증 등급을 부여하는 단체품질인증제도입니다. (다중이용시설 등의 실내공기질 관리법 제11조 관련)</p></div><img style=\"width: 196px\" src=\"https://www.kccworld.co.kr/assets/images/ho/bm/img_hb_mark.jpg\" />\r\n\r\n</div></div></body></html>","additional":[],"unconfirmed":false}